{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51288","headline":"画像题诗 · 杜甫","name":"画像题诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迎旦东风骑蹇驴，旋呵冻手暖髯须。\n洛阳无限丹青手，还有功夫画我无？\n（《苕溪渔隐丛话後集》八云：「世有碑本子美画像，上有诗云云。\n子美决不肯自作，兼集中亦无之，必好事者爲之也。\n」又《诗人玉屑》十一《考证》云：「『迎旦东风骑蹇驴』，决非唐人气象，只似白乐天言语。\n今者世俗图画，以爲少陵诗，渔隐亦辨其非矣。\n黄伯思编入《杜集》，非也。\n」〖《诗人玉屑》所引，见《沧浪诗话·考证》。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}